# Handoff
This repo uses its own docs. Do not create `.必要流程说明/`, `当前状态.md`, `协作记忆.md`, `工作内容/`, or `窗口协同.md`.

Start: read `docs/README.md` and `docs/01-development/交接记录.md` (when 「下一步」 is active, take one step only); the latest two 「本轮」 sections (decided — follow them); the ADR for the current task. The user's current decision takes priority. Leave raw materials unchanged. Historical procedures, suggested parameters, and simulated data are not formal approval.

Finish (after demoable progress — code, config, release, root cause; not pure Q&A), all three:
1. Append a 「本轮」 section to `docs/01-development/交接记录.md`. Cover 实际完成, 命令, 结果, 未完成, and 下一步. Next steps count only when written there.
2. Append a new requirement decision to the relevant ADR under `docs/03-architecture/`. Append only. When overturning, write 「被取代：见 xxx」.
3. Append phase work that was committed but not finished this round to `docs/01-development/一期未完成事项.md`. Later-phase capabilities stay in the existing 「本期不做」 or follow-up sections. Remove or mark an item complete after it is done.

Work log is the 「本轮」 section. Free form, cut to the content:
- Title `## 本轮：<one sentence on what was done>`.
- Ordinary change: cause → what changed → verification → 未完成.
- Release: scope → version and rollback → database change (if any) → runtime verification → 尚未验证.
- Investigation: reproduce → root-cause chain → proposal.
- Real numbers only (no 大概/应该/预计). Leftovers under 未完成, 仍未解决, or 尚未验证.
- Do not use the fill-in template of 「作者 / 时间 / 主题」 plus numbered sections 「一、二、三」.

Window slicing (曲箭龙 2026-10-05, paths bound to this repo 2026-10-08):
- One window = one slice: one plan step, or a small cluster of acceptances that still ends handed off.
- At slice end, remind 曲箭龙 to switch windows, and start no new large slice, if this window has already read or written a large set of files, early details need re-reading, or the history is being compressed.
- Before switching, write a 「窗口交接」 section in `docs/01-development/交接记录.md`: done; current slice and the first next action; pending decisions; clusters still running (branch, worktree, log). Completion notices return only to the dispatching window. Sync 「下一步」.
